WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Codilo — a small, fast code editor.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The Explorer lists a React project with TypeScript code.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Two panes show code and CSS side by side.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A built-in terminal opens below.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The language menu offers thirty-five modes, including JavaScript, Rust, Go and SQL.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The command palette finds every action.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The light theme brightens the editor.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Codilo. Small. Fast. Yours.
